# 💻 PRAKTIČNI NAMIGI ZA RAZVIJALCE

## Kako Dodati Nov Event?

### Korak 1: Definiraj Delegate
```csharp
public class MyClass
{
    // 1. Definiraj tip delegata
    public delegate void MyEventHandler(string data);
}
```

### Korak 2: Definiraj Event
```csharp
public event MyEventHandler MyEvent;
```

### Korak 3: Spro­ži Event
```csharp
protected virtual void OnMyEvent(string data)
{
    MyEvent?.Invoke(data);  // Null-safe
}

// Pokličem to, ko se kaj zgodi
public void DoSomething()
{
    OnMyEvent("Kaj se je zgodilo!");
}
```

### Korak 4: Definiraj Handler
```csharp
private void MyEventHandler(string data)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Dogodek: {data}");
}
```

### Korak 5: Naroči se
```csharp
public Form1()
{
    myObject.MyEvent += MyEventHandler;
}
```

