## EventArgs - Kako Prosljeđivati Podatke?

### Prilagođeni EventArgs
```csharp
// 1. Definiram custom EventArgs
public class PlaylistErrorEventArgs : EventArgs
{
    public string Sporocilo { get; set; }
    public ErrorType Tip { get; set; }
}

// 2. Definiram event z mojimi EventArgs
public event EventHandler<PlaylistErrorEventArgs> PlaylistError;

// 3. Ustvarim instance z podatki
OnPlaylistError(new PlaylistErrorEventArgs("Napaka!", ErrorType.Other));

// 4. Handler dobi podatke
private void playlist_PlaylistError(object sender, PlaylistErrorEventArgs e)
{
    Console.WriteLine(e.Sporocilo);  // "Napaka!"
    Console.WriteLine(e.Tip);         // Other
}
```

